<title>USA: New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Sept 16.</title>
<headline>New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Sept 16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN 56,500 long tons iron ore 1-8/10 Pt Cartier/Mobile $3.75 fio five days Kleimar.</p>
<p>Ratna Deep 70,000 long tons iron ore 30/9-9/10 Nouadhibou/Ghent $4.15 fio five days Coe &amp; Cleric.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212-859-1640</p>
